# 優化方案 M：每次 push 跑規則測試＋100 組鏡像；Windows 與 Linux 跑同一組測試，比對指紋一致（跨平台確定性）。
# 只改 docs/ 或 coordination/ 不跑（省 Actions 額度）。平衡完整報表約 10 分鐘，只在手動觸發時跑。
name: ci
on:
  push:
    paths-ignore: ["docs/**", "coordination/**", "*.md"]
  workflow_dispatch:
    inputs:
      balance:
        description: "也跑完整平衡報表"
        type: boolean
        default: false
env:
  GODOT_VERSION: "4.6.2"
jobs:
  linux:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    timeout-minutes: 30
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - name: 安裝 Godot
        run: |
          curl -sSL -o g.zip "https://github.com/godotengine/godot/releases/download/${GODOT_VERSION}-stable/Godot_v${GODOT_VERSION}-stable_linux.x86_64.zip"
          unzip -q g.zip && mv Godot_v${GODOT_VERSION}-stable_linux.x86_64 godot && chmod +x godot
      - name: 匯入
        run: ./godot --headless --path game --import || true
      - name: 規則測試
        run: ./godot --headless --path game --script res://tests/run_tests.gd | tee test.log && grep -q '0 失敗' test.log
      - name: 100 組左右交換逐 tick 鏡像
        run: ./godot --headless --path game --script res://tools/mirror_100.gd | tee mirror.log && grep -q '100/100' mirror.log
      - name: 素材登記
        run: python3 game/tools/check_assets.py
      - name: 平衡報表（手動）
        if: ${{ inputs.balance }}
        run: GODOT=$PWD/godot SHARDS=4 game/tools/balance.sh ../docs/balance-runs/ci
      - run: grep FINGERPRINT test.log > fp-linux.txt
      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
        with: { name: fp-linux, path: fp-linux.txt }
  windows:
    runs-on: windows-latest
    timeout-minutes: 30
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - name: 安裝 Godot
        shell: bash
        run: |
          curl -sSL -o g.zip "https://github.com/godotengine/godot/releases/download/${GODOT_VERSION}-stable/Godot_v${GODOT_VERSION}-stable_win64.exe.zip"
          unzip -q g.zip && mv Godot_v${GODOT_VERSION}-stable_win64.exe godot.exe
      - shell: bash
        run: ./godot.exe --headless --path game --import || true
      - shell: bash
        run: ./godot.exe --headless --path game --script res://tests/run_tests.gd | tee test.log && grep -q '0 失敗' test.log && grep FINGERPRINT test.log > fp-windows.txt
      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
        with: { name: fp-windows, path: fp-windows.txt }
  compare:
    needs: [linux, windows]
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/download-artifact@v4
      - name: Windows／Linux 指紋必須一致
        run: diff fp-linux/fp-linux.txt fp-windows/fp-windows.txt
